---
// ── How it works ──────────────────────────────────────
---

<section class="section">
  <h2 class="h">How it works</h2>
  <p class="section-desc" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:1.75rem">
    Three steps, and the middle one is a registry you already have.
  </p>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="n">01 · BUILD</div>
      <h3>Build</h3>
      <p>Package your kernel and root filesystem into one portable image.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="n">02 · DISTRIBUTE</div>
      <h3>Distribute</h3>
      <p>Push it to any OCI registry, the same place your container images live.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="n">03 · RUN</div>
      <h3>Run</h3>
      <p>Pull and boot it anywhere — laptop, cloud, or bare metal.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="fanout">
    <div class="fan-img">one portable image</div>
    <div class="fan-arrows" aria-hidden="true">↙ ↓ ↘</div>
    <div class="fan-targets">
      <span class="fan-t">your laptop</span>
      <span class="fan-t">the cloud</span>
      <span class="fan-t">bare metal</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .fanout {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .fan-img {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .fan-arrows {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.5rem;
  }
  .fan-targets {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .fan-t {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--fg);
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
